		"You just unlocked the most important semiconductor in the pack — now you can return to the &dRefined Storage&r branch in Era 1 and begin mass-producing processors and storage disks!"
	]
	quest.12D103672723A875.quest_subtitle: "Key to Refined Storage digital memory"
	quest.12D103672723A875.title: "Semiconductors: Silicon Ingot"
	quest.135A776141E985F5.quest_desc: ["Connect an &6Engine Controller&r to your TFMG drive unit to fine-tune throttle, ignition, and engine operating parameters."]
	quest.135A776141E985F5.quest_subtitle: "Managing TFMG engine operation and RPM"
	quest.135A776141E985F5.title: "Engineer's Console: Engine Controller"
	quest.13D5F689E6884281.quest_desc: ["&eKobolediator&r is one of the pyramid's two mini-bosses — a tough gladiator inflicting Mining Fatigue and charging players."]
	quest.13D5F689E6884281.title: "&eKobolediator"
	quest.1403D677CF2815C3.quest_desc: ["An upgraded &5&lReforging Table&r breaks past the basic table's limits, letting you reforge items using &5Epic&r and &6Mythic&r materials!"]
	quest.1403D677CF2815C3.title: "(Upgraded) &5&lReforging Table&r"
	quest.145E7D1A88B83DDD.quest_desc: ["Wraps the wearer in an aura of invisibility, making it harder for monsters to detect your presence."]
	quest.145E7D1A88B83DDD.quest_subtitle: "Scarf (Necklace)"
	quest.145E7D1A88B83DDD.title: "&9Scarf of Invisibility&r"
	quest.148A33CC36B2563A.quest_desc: ["&dDraconic Endshelf&r forged with a &dDragon Head&r is the only shelf that lets you reach the final cap of &a100 Eterna&r!"]
	quest.148A33CC36B2563A.title: "&dDraconic Endshelf"
	quest.152852C93E3A82F4.quest_desc: ["A stationary fluid storage block holding 64 buckets, ready to be wired straight into your Refined Storage network."]
	quest.152852C93E3A82F4.quest_subtitle: "1x 64b Fluid Storage Block"
	quest.152852C93E3A82F4.title: "Stationary Fluid Bank 64b"
	quest.157C30BEA13822AD.quest_desc: ["Small copper coins (Spurs) — the basic currency for the simplest trades."]
	quest.157C30BEA13822AD.quest_subtitle: "128x Spur"
	quest.157C30BEA13822AD.title: "Currency: Copper Spurs"
	quest.158B24939A269D83.quest_desc: ["A Tip Upgrade lets you raise the mining tier of a finished tool — for example, applying a diamond tip to an iron pickaxe lets it mine obsidian!"]
	quest.158B24939A269D83.quest_subtitle: "When you only have 1 diamond"
	quest.158B24939A269D83.title: "Cast: Tip Cast"
	quest.158F872A3A2C3650.quest_desc: [
		"With access to &a80 Eterna&r, you can infuse &dDragon's Breath&r!"
		""
		"Reach the required stats (&a80 Eterna&r, &c25% Quanta&r, &5100% Arcana&r) using: 4x &9Echoing Sculkshelf&r, 4x &9Soul-Touched Sculkshelf&r, and 6x &6Geode-Encased Bookshelf of Stability&r."
	]
	quest.158F872A3A2C3650.title: "&dInfused Dragon's Breath"
	quest.1617C1935F22FBD1.quest_desc: [
		"Infuse a mythic &6Godforged Pearl&r at full &a100 Eterna&r, &c9.65–11% Quanta&r, and &558.75–60% Arcana&r."
		""
		"Required setup: 1x &dDraconic Endshelf&r, 6x &6Geode-Encased Bookshelf&r, 1x &9Echoing Sculkshelf&r, 5x &9Soul-Touched Sculkshelf&r, 1x &7Stoneshelf&r, and 1 Candle."
	]
	quest.1617C1935F22FBD1.quest_subtitle: "Alchemy of godly pearls"
	quest.1617C1935F22FBD1.title: "&6God-Fused Pearl"
	quest.161A90E134592D0E.quest_desc: ["Smelting &cEverlasting Beef&r in a furnace yields &4Eternal Steak&r — an infinite steak restoring much more hunger and saturation!"]
	quest.161A90E134592D0E.quest_subtitle: "Unique"
	quest.161A90E134592D0E.title: "&4Eternal Steak"
	quest.16255FB20F35A9D9.quest_desc: ["&3Snorkel&r provides an underwater air supply when submerged, making ocean structure exploration easier."]
	quest.16255FB20F35A9D9.quest_subtitle: "Head"
	quest.16255FB20F35A9D9.title: "&3Snorkel"
	quest.1635E2B0D5A83588.quest_desc: ["A reactor without cooling is a ticking time bomb. Include enough &bReactor Cooler&r blocks in the reactor structure to maintain safe thermal limits at full power."]
	quest.1635E2B0D5A83588.quest_subtitle: "Protection against overheating and meltdown"
	quest.1635E2B0D5A83588.title: "Thermal Regulation: Reactor Cooler"
	quest.166B94A48B3625D5.quest_desc: ["Basic fuel for your first furnaces and boilers. Gather a solid stash of coal before moving on to liquid fuels."]
	quest.166B94A48B3625D5.quest_subtitle: "32x Coal"
	quest.166B94A48B3625D5.title: "Black Gold: Coal"
	quest.166CE4243896A0CD.quest_desc: ["Want to boost your gems' power? At the &a&lGem Cutting Table&r you can combine two identical gems of the same quality with gem dust and rarity materials, raising their purity all the way to &zPerfect&r!"]
	quest.166CE4243896A0CD.title: "Cutting &aGems"
	quest.167E1474644C9908.quest_desc: [
		"Quartz lets you invert the effect of any modifier rune."
		""
		"Holding Quartz in your offhand and a rune in your main hand applies the opposite effect — for example, shrinking the spawn range instead of expanding it."
	]
	quest.167E1474644C9908.title: "Effect Inversion: Quartz"
	quest.1695917695648018.quest_desc: ["&3Abandoned Temple&r is a frozen temple guarded by &3Draugrs&r — at its peak you'll find chests with valuable loot."]
	quest.1695917695648018.title: "&3Abandoned Temple"
	quest.16C74B5F99AD6724.quest_desc: [
		"&8Common&r is the most basic rarity tier, widespread in the &9Haven&r world tier."
		""
		"&8Mysterious Scrap Metal&r is obtained by salvaging common items at the &c&lSalvaging Table&r."
	]
	quest.16C74B5F99AD6724.quest_subtitle: "&8Common"
	quest.16C74B5F99AD6724.title: "&8Mysterious Scrap Metal"
	quest.17410BE15A81DD96.quest_desc: [
		"&9Wayfarer's Spawner Upgrade Rune&r is the second spawner upgrade tier (you can use any spawn egg to craft it):"
		""
		"• Min delay: 100 ticks"
		"• Max delay: 400 ticks"
		"• Mobs per cycle: 10"
		"• Nearby entity cap: 18"
		"• Player activation range: 32 blocks"
	]
	quest.17410BE15A81DD96.title: "Upgrade Rune II: Ascent"
	quest.1744E700CF742CE2.quest_desc: ["&5Coralssus&r is a mighty coral colossus guarding the prisons in the Sunken City. Drops &5Coral Chunk&r needed to craft the Abyssal Sacrifice."]
	quest.1744E700CF742CE2.title: "&5Coralssus&r"
	quest.177D8EE9F636BFB8.quest_desc: [
		"A factory full of resources is only half the story — true industrial power begins where production surpluses turn into hard currency!"
		""
		"In &6AeroStratum&r, the economy runs on coins from &eCreate: Numismatics&r (from humble &7Spurs&r and &7Bevels&r up to valuable &6Crowns&r and &bSuns&r). Instead of hoarding thousands of excess items in storage, you can bring them to market."
		""
		"&lHow to start earning?&r"
		"• &aLocal Trade and Vendors:&r In the first part of this chapter you'll learn to manage your bank account, use payment cards, and place your own vending machines (&eAndesite&r and &6Brass Vendors&r). They let you trade automatically with other players and profit from your catalog 24/7."
		"• &bRailways and Mass Export:&r When local trade isn't enough, the second part of the tree takes you into heavy rail logistics! You'll build your own freight train network for mass transport and worldwide export."
		""
		"Click the checkmark below to learn the ropes of the economy and open your first shop!"
	]
	quest.177D8EE9F636BFB8.quest_subtitle: "Scaling profits to a global level"
	quest.177D8EE9F636BFB8.title: "TRADE"
	quest.179A2967D712CE85.quest_desc: ["Infusing nether quartz with a massive amount of redstone dust creates a crystal capable of conducting and amplifying energy pulses."]
	quest.179A2967D712CE85.quest_subtitle: "1x Rose Quartz"
	quest.179A2967D712CE85.title: "Crystalline Resonance: Rose Quartz"
	quest.17C87EB8ED8A27AB.quest_desc: ["Spawner Runes are the base crafting component required to make basic spawner upgrades."]
	quest.17C87EB8ED8A27AB.quest_subtitle: "Basic modifications"
	quest.17C87EB8ED8A27AB.title: "Spawner Rune"
	quest.17CA9D80D8EC3EF7.quest_desc: ["&4&lThe Harbinger&r is a flying war machine powered by a Nether Star. It bombards the arena with homing Wither missiles, mortars, and a powerful laser beam (tip: EMP pulses can briefly stun it!)."]
	quest.17CA9D80D8EC3EF7.title: "&4&lThe Harbinger&r"
	quest.186593EBCE3FE8D8.quest_desc: ["Increases the radius around the spawner where monsters can spawn (or decreases it if you hold Quartz in your offhand, making tight drop chambers easier to build)."]
	quest.186593EBCE3FE8D8.title: "Spawn Range"
	quest.1873205CF5247E3E.quest_desc: ["&dEndshelves&r crafted from infused dragon's breath and end stone bricks let you raise &aEterna&r all the way to &a90&r!"]
	quest.1873205CF5247E3E.title: "&dEndshelves"
	quest.18A64670D9EE86E8.quest_desc: ["Grey, unassuming stone that forms the foundation of all Create technology. Mine a full stack of andesite — you'll need it sooner than you think!"]
	quest.18A64670D9EE86E8.quest_subtitle: "64x Andesite"
	quest.18A64670D9EE86E8.title: "Foundation of Engineering: Andesite"
	quest.18AA64DF63F68762.quest_desc: ["A node connecting the Hellshelf and Seashelf paths before advancing to the Ascent tier."]
