		"Their strength and loot quality depend on your selected &lWorld Tier&r! You can open the World Tiers menu anytime with &e[ CTRL + T ]&r."
	]
	quest.196312DF0D2E2CB6.title: "&4Invaders&r and &lWorld Tiers"
	quest.19A6770AFA254074.quest_desc: ["Craft a &6Large Engine&r — a heavy industrial engine designed for long-term operation under full load in a foundry or factory."]
