	quest.1B7A15730657ED30.quest_desc: ["&eDesert Site&r is a sprawling desert excavation guarded by &eKoboletons&r and &eWadjets&r — watch out for hidden traps near chests!"]
	quest.1B7A15730657ED30.title: "&eDesert Site"
	quest.1B93CC74B13084E5.quest_desc: ["Once dried and processed, kelp becomes a surprisingly flexible and tough material akin to industrial rubber. Gather a solid stash from the ocean floor — no assembly line will run without it."]
