		"• &dTeleportation&r: Lets you blink forward a short distance, consuming internal charges that regenerate over time."
	]
	quest.1E2A9446594638E2.quest_subtitle: "Blink through space"
	quest.1E2A9446594638E2.title: "&dChorus Staff&r"
	quest.1E2F1E036716C031.quest_desc: ["Cast used for pouring slingshot forks that launch small pebbles."]
	quest.1E2F1E036716C031.title: "Cast: Slingshot Cast"
	quest.1E3C2E5663DE1F3F.quest_desc: [
		"The pinnacle of precision mechanics! Set up a row of Deployers over an assembly belt and automate Precision Mechanism production."
		""
		"Mastering this process opens the gates to advanced logistics, brass machines, and full automation. Welcome to Era 2!"
	]
	quest.1E3C2E5663DE1F3F.quest_subtitle: "Era 1 Milestone"
	quest.1E3C2E5663DE1F3F.title: "Golden Heart of Automation: Precision Mechanism"
	quest.1E40ACF3E69A4100.quest_desc: ["&6Antidote Vessel&r drastically shortens the duration of negative effects (such as Poison or Wither)."]
	quest.1E40ACF3E69A4100.quest_subtitle: "Belt"
	quest.1E40ACF3E69A4100.title: "&6Antidote Vessel&r"
	quest.1E594C2643B8B4C0.quest_desc: [
		"Your &dRefined Storage&r digital warehouse requires steady electrical power (&cFE&r). Your drive shafts can become your first power plant!"
		""
		"Assemble an &6Alternator&r on a sequenced line and connect it to a fast-spinning shaft. The higher the RPM fed into it, the more power the generator produces."
	]
	quest.1E594C2643B8B4C0.quest_subtitle: "Converting kinetic power (SU) into electrical energy (FE)"
	quest.1E594C2643B8B4C0.title: "First Current: Alternator"
	quest.1E8357755479E259.quest_desc: ["Cast used for pouring a crossbow body with high piercing power."]
	quest.1E8357755479E259.title: "Cast: Crossbow Cast"
	quest.1F748ACA3976A92F.quest_desc: ["A node linking the Hellshelf or Seashelf path with the requirement to unlock the Frontier world tier."]
	quest.1F748ACA3976A92F.title: "Path Choice"
	quest.1FAFDB20F504688E.quest_desc: [
		"&5&lApothic Enchanting&r completely overhauls the enchanting mechanic."
		""
		"A standard 15 bookshelves is just the beginning — new shelf types let you control three altar stats (&aEterna&r, &cQuanta&r, &5Arcana&r) and perform &d&lInfusion&r rituals!"
	]
	quest.1FAFDB20F504688E.title: "&5&lApothic Enchanting"
	quest.1FD4C76E36F0E323.quest_desc: ["An alternative to nuclear power is the might of oil and biodiesel! Construct a &6Large Diesel Engine&r — a modular combustion engine you can link in long rows along a single drive shaft."]
	quest.1FD4C76E36F0E323.quest_subtitle: "Modular diesel engines"
	quest.1FD4C76E36F0E323.title: "Heavy Diesel: Large Diesel Engine"
	quest.1FD7EB7910170E8D.quest_desc: ["Copper is key to mastering pipes, pressure tanks, and smelting brass in upcoming eras."]
	quest.1FD7EB7910170E8D.quest_subtitle: "16x Copper Ingot"
	quest.1FD7EB7910170E8D.title: "Industrial Ores: Copper"
	quest.2002C7EB13626AE7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sigil of Enhancement&r fuels the &6&lAugmenting Table&r."
		""
		"Each reroll of a single affix costs 1 sigil, and upgrading it to a higher tier costs 2 sigils."
	]
	quest.2002C7EB13626AE7.title: "&6Sigil of Enhancement"
	quest.200DFE86A1BCAE00.quest_desc: ["An automated &bDestructor&r breaks blocks in front of it and sends the output straight to your network disks."]
	quest.200DFE86A1BCAE00.quest_subtitle: "1x Destructor"
	quest.200DFE86A1BCAE00.title: "Automated Miner: Destructor"
	quest.2011638351B67396.quest_desc: ["The &9Astrape&r spear forged from Essence of the Storm and Lacrima gives long melee reach and lets you hurl lightning bolts when holding right-click!"]
	quest.2011638351B67396.title: "&9Astrape"
	quest.2098D8BFADB55D2A.quest_desc: ["Armor lining blueprint adding a soft protective layer inside armor."]
	quest.2098D8BFADB55D2A.title: "Blueprint: Lining Blueprint"
	quest.21234BB40DB05C78.quest_desc: ["Cast used for pouring bracelets that boost character stats."]
	quest.21234BB40DB05C78.title: "Cast: Bracelet Cast"
	quest.213EB741245A7B27.quest_desc: ["A high-capacity hard drive holding 16,384 items inside a Disk Drive."]
	quest.213EB741245A7B27.quest_subtitle: "1x 16k Storage Disk"
	quest.213EB741245A7B27.title: "16k Data Disk"
	quest.2156C00E30424844.quest_desc: ["A &4Foundry Tank&r is the foundry's fuel tank — fill it with &cLava&r to power the coils in the furnace floor."]
	quest.2156C00E30424844.title: "&l&cFoundry&r &4Tanks"
	quest.21A0FD474FBB49F7.quest_desc: ["&dRuined Citadel&r is an obsidian and purpur fortress on the outer End islands, guarded by Shulkers, &dEndermapteras&r, and &dEnder Golems&r."]
	quest.21A0FD474FBB49F7.title: "&dRuined Citadel&r: Lair of &d&lEnder Guardian&r"
	quest.21BEE9867796933A.quest_desc: [
		"A nomad flute that safely stores up to &c2 tamed mounts&r inside."
		""
		"• &6Stable&r: Right-click a mount to store it in the flute or summon it back. Switch between stored mounts using Shift + scroll wheel."
	]
	quest.21BEE9867796933A.quest_subtitle: "Store and summon your mounts"
	quest.21BEE9867796933A.title: "&cRider Flute&r"
	quest.2215FB0777D7029D.quest_desc: ["&7Steadfast Spikes&r protect against knockback, eliminate slipping on ice, and let you slowly slide down vertical walls."]
	quest.2215FB0777D7029D.quest_subtitle: "Feet"
	quest.2215FB0777D7029D.title: "&7Steadfast Spikes&r"
	quest.221C9EDA651144BA.quest_desc: ["With a &3Charm of Sinking&r you move along the ocean floor as freely as if there were no water around you (just watch your air supply!)."]
	quest.221C9EDA651144BA.quest_subtitle: "Necklace"
	quest.221C9EDA651144BA.title: "&3Charm of Sinking&r"
	quest.222D08F43B995FED.quest_desc: ["Cast used for pouring a modular trident head from chosen metal alloys."]
	quest.222D08F43B995FED.quest_subtitle: "Ruler of the seas"
	quest.222D08F43B995FED.title: "Cast: Trident Cast"
	quest.223A5BDB5056B781.quest_desc: ["Capturing is a sword enchantment that gives a chance (0.5% per enchantment level, up to level VII) for a defeated monster to drop its spawn egg."]
	quest.223A5BDB5056B781.title: "Enchantment: Capturing"
	quest.224716A537F2FFA0.quest_desc: ["&8Armor Tomes&r roll only enchantments meant for a specific armor piece (helmet, chestplate, leggings, or boots)."]
	quest.224716A537F2FFA0.title: "&8Armor Tomes"
	quest.226FB6C7CF3FEFB3.quest_desc: ["During this adventure, a backpack will be essential for survival. Make one as soon as you can (you'll need leather)."]
	quest.226FB6C7CF3FEFB3.quest_subtitle: "A collector's best friend - BACKPACK"
	quest.226FB6C7CF3FEFB3.title: "Most Important Accessory"
	quest.2289860C15742201.quest_desc: ["Soaking obsidian powder in lava and pressing it with a Mechanical Press creates an ultra-tough Sturdy Sheet capable of withstanding heavy rail loads."]
	quest.2289860C15742201.quest_subtitle: "1x Sturdy Sheet"
	quest.2289860C15742201.title: "Armored Plate: Sturdy Sheet"
	quest.22A0A9C81A5C85A1.quest_desc: ["A binding blueprint joining a tool head to its shaft."]
	quest.22A0A9C81A5C85A1.quest_subtitle: "Holds it all together"
	quest.22A0A9C81A5C85A1.title: "Blueprint: Binding Blueprint"
	quest.22C51025DC42CDE2.quest_desc: ["Cast used for pouring leggings plates."]
	quest.22C51025DC42CDE2.title: "Cast: Leggings Cast"
	quest.22E57BF23B9BA2C5.quest_desc: ["Gather a reserve of gem dust needed for advanced crafting in higher world tiers."]
	quest.22E57BF23B9BA2C5.title: "Gem Dust Reserves"
	quest.235E3C386E8D36A3.quest_desc: ["Here the infernal and aquatic paths merge into one! Craft a &9Dormant Deepshelf&r from deepslate and books, then infuse it at &a60 Eterna&r, &c40% Quanta&r, and &540% Arcana&r (12x Crystalline Seashelf or 13x Glowing Hellshelf)."]
	quest.235E3C386E8D36A3.title: "&9Deepshelf"
	quest.236EA8D18ECD5FE8.quest_desc: ["&bIgnited Berserker&r spawns in Nether Fortresses and drops &bDying Embers&r (4 combine into 1 Burning Ashes)."]
	quest.236EA8D18ECD5FE8.title: "&bIgnited Berserker"
	quest.24391162F4FF0587.quest_desc: [
		"With 15 &bSeashelf&r blocks around the table you can perform an infusion creating an &bInfused Seashelf&r!"
		""
		"Each grants &a+5 Eterna&r (up to &a60&r cap) and &5+5% Arcana&r."
	]
	quest.24391162F4FF0587.title: "&bInfused Seashelf"
	quest.243D55E17CC9B04A.quest_desc: [
		"To make life easier, remember these essential hotkeys:"
		""
		"[ M ] – Opens the world map (Xaero's or JourneyMap)."
		"[ R ] / [ U ] – Hovering over an item in your inventory lets you check how to craft it (R) or what it's used for (U)."
		"[ W ] – Ponder animation showing how a Create component works and where it's used."
		"[ ~ ] (Tilde) – Activates FTB Ultimine. Hold this key while mining to break an entire ore vein at once!"
		"[ B ] – Quick access to your backpack (Sophisticated Backpacks)."
	]
	quest.243D55E17CC9B04A.quest_subtitle: "(Important Keys)"
	quest.243D55E17CC9B04A.title: "Survival Handbook"
	quest.24C757B8AA6841F6.quest_desc: ["Craft an &3Inert Trident&r and perform an &d&lInfusion&r (min. &a40 Eterna&r, &c20–50% Quanta&r, &535% Arcana&r) to obtain a full &3Trident&r!"]
	quest.24C757B8AA6841F6.title: "Creating a &3Trident"
	quest.24D11ED5F4EEDC48.quest_desc: [
		"To socket a gem into a weapon or armor piece, the item must have an open &9Socket&r."
		""
		"Combine your item with a &9Sigil of Socketing&r at a &8&lSmithing Table&r to unlock an extra gem socket on it!"
	]
	quest.24D11ED5F4EEDC48.title: "&9Sigil of Socketing"
	quest.24E0B7BE9E8CAF99.quest_desc: ["A docking station holding up to 8 storage disks. Connect it to a Controller, insert disks, and enjoy centralized storage."]
	quest.24E0B7BE9E8CAF99.quest_subtitle: "1x Disk Drive"
	quest.24E0B7BE9E8CAF99.title: "Server Rack: Disk Drive"
	quest.24F68B7E8A51E6FD.quest_desc: ["A specialized compute core responsible for materializing objects from digital form."]
	quest.24F68B7E8A51E6FD.quest_subtitle: "1x Construction Core"
	quest.24F68B7E8A51E6FD.title: "Construction Core"
	quest.24FCFF18296ED907.quest_desc: [
		"Requires Sculk blocks, a Sculk catalyst, and a &9Warden Tendril&r trophy from a defeated Warden."
		""
		"Grants &a+10 Eterna&r, &c+15% Quanta&r, &5+10% Arcana&r, and raises the Eterna cap to &a80&r!"
	]
	quest.24FCFF18296ED907.title: "&9Soul-Touched Sculkshelf"
	quest.2542D8A6894816C6.quest_desc: ["&eEye of Desert&r points across the desert toward a &eCursed Pyramid&r, where &e&lAncient Remnant&r slumbers."]
	quest.2542D8A6894816C6.title: "&eEye of Desert&r"
	quest.25ACB08E4F12CE79.quest_desc: ["Place a &cNetherite Effigy&r and feed it a &cLava Power Cell&r to bring to life your own tamed mini-colossus with 15 inventory slots!"]
	quest.25ACB08E4F12CE79.title: "&cNetherite Ministrosity"
	quest.25DB44EB6E7DA3B0.quest_desc: ["This is the most important material in all of Era 0. Combining plain andesite with iron nuggets (or zinc) creates an exceptionally malleable and sturdy alloy. You'll need hundreds, if not thousands, of them. Stock up!"]
	quest.25DB44EB6E7DA3B0.quest_subtitle: "8x Andesite Alloy"
	quest.25DB44EB6E7DA3B0.title: "Magical Bond: Andesite Alloy"
	quest.2607F3DC07049785.quest_desc: ["A practical helmet with drink holders that noticeably speeds up eating food and drinking potions."]
	quest.2607F3DC07049785.quest_subtitle: "Head"
	quest.2607F3DC07049785.title: "&6Plastic Drinking Hat"
	quest.26171E29A87D7516.quest_desc: ["&eTrain Controls&r mounted on a locomotive let you drive the train manually and serve as an anchor point for a conductor or automated schedule."]
	quest.26171E29A87D7516.quest_subtitle: "1x Train Controls"
	quest.26171E29A87D7516.title: "Engineer's Desk: Train Controls"
	quest.262036FE8E87F50A.quest_desc: ["Cast used for pouring a heavy mining hammer that mines stone in a 3x3 area!"]
	quest.262036FE8E87F50A.quest_subtitle: "3x3 mining"
	quest.262036FE8E87F50A.title: "Cast: Hammer Cast"
	quest.2620887DD91A83FA.quest_desc: ["Polished lava quartz stabilizes thermal flows, serving as a key component for building modern drive conduits."]
	quest.2620887DD91A83FA.quest_subtitle: "1x Polished Lava Quartz"
	quest.2620887DD91A83FA.title: "Polished Lava Quartz"
	quest.267ABF42F9628FEA.quest_desc: ["The heart of every Refined Storage system. Feed it electrical power (FE) and it brings all connected terminals, drives, and interfaces to life."]
	quest.267ABF42F9628FEA.quest_subtitle: "1x Controller"
	quest.267ABF42F9628FEA.title: "Brain of Operations: Network Controller"
	quest.269AB30A3588E4CD.quest_desc: ["Every great engineer started out getting their hands dirty. Before building steam factories, you have to survive your first night. Gather some stone, make basic tools, and get ready for hard work."]
	quest.269AB30A3588E4CD.quest_subtitle: "16x Cobblestone"
	quest.269AB30A3588E4CD.title: "Pick Up That Rock"
	quest.26BC21D45C12461D.quest_desc: [
		"Regular charcoal or coal is too impure to power the Blast Furnace. Build &69 Coke Oven blocks&r and assemble them into a multiblock structure."
		""
		"Remember to vent the creosote and exhaust gases produced during the process using pipes!"
	]
	quest.26BC21D45C12461D.quest_subtitle: "Baking coal without oxygen"
	quest.26BC21D45C12461D.title: "Coking Battery: Coke Oven"
	quest.26EB8490366CC44A.quest_desc: ["Pulls finished products or fluids from chests, tanks, and machines straight onto your Refined Storage network disks."]
	quest.26EB8490366CC44A.quest_subtitle: "1x Importer"
	quest.26EB8490366CC44A.title: "Input Node: Importer"
	quest.26F9DB31A835B69C.quest_desc: ["Mount a &7Foundry Tap&r on a drain block (&bDrain&r), and place a &8Casting Table&r (for pouring ingots and tool parts) or a &8Casting Basin&r (for pouring full metal blocks) directly underneath it."]
	quest.26F9DB31A835B69C.title: "Casting Stations"
	quest.2790EB2E347D28DE.quest_desc: ["You have defeated all eight ancient rulers of Cataclysm across the world! Claim your well-earned slayer reward."]
	quest.2790EB2E347D28DE.quest_subtitle: "Defeat all 8 Cataclysm bosses"
	quest.2790EB2E347D28DE.title: "Cataclysm Slayer"
	quest.27E951F4F4F6F847.quest_desc: ["&cFlame Pendant&r has a chance to set an attacking enemy on fire while granting you Fire Resistance."]
	quest.27E951F4F4F6F847.quest_subtitle: "Necklace"
	quest.27E951F4F4F6F847.title: "&cFlame Pendant&r"
	quest.28D3A1D0B60D86C5.quest_desc: ["A brass extruder lets you generate End Stone right in your factory, without manually digging apart islands in the End."]
	quest.28D3A1D0B60D86C5.quest_subtitle: "64x End Stone"
	quest.28D3A1D0B60D86C5.title: "Advanced Extrusion: End Stone"
	quest.28D87E55181358DF.quest_desc: ["Prepare &6Cast Iron Pipes&r. Unlike copper pipes from Create, cast iron piping is required when building foundry hardware and coking installations."]
	quest.28D87E55181358DF.quest_subtitle: "Transporting hot gases and industrial fluids"
	quest.28D87E55181358DF.title: "Foundry Piping: Cast Iron Pipes"
	quest.28F71A7A1ACBE9E0.quest_desc: [
		"When you want to move thousands of items from old 1k disks onto higher-capacity drives or empty external drives brought back from an expedition, manual swapping won't cut it."
		""
		"Build a &bDisk Interface&r — a device that automatically pumps the contents of an inserted disk straight into your main &dRefined Storage&r storage network."
	]
	quest.28F71A7A1ACBE9E0.quest_subtitle: "Fast data migration between drives"
	quest.28F71A7A1ACBE9E0.title: "Bulk Transfer: Disk Interface"
	quest.290B16E2D899BB92.quest_desc: ["An advanced Lava Tube from the engine add-on is a powerful transfer component built to withstand the extreme temperatures of molten materials."]
	quest.290B16E2D899BB92.quest_subtitle: "1x Lava Tube"
	quest.290B16E2D899BB92.title: "Thermal Bus: Lava Tube"
	quest.29131C3532610ADF.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 Pillar Cap for the Starlight Charger structure."]
	quest.29131C3532610ADF.title: "Pillar Cap II: Azure Electrum"
	quest.291C76140DE97E3C.quest_desc: ["&bIgnitium&r ingots obtained from defeating Ignis are used to forge armor above Netherite tier and powerful fire weapons."]
	quest.291C76140DE97E3C.quest_subtitle: "Stronger than Netherite"
	quest.291C76140DE97E3C.title: "&bIgnitium"
	quest.29448D08C8777425.quest_desc: ["&cAngler's Hat&r speeds up fishing bites and increases the chance of reeling in rare treasures."]
	quest.29448D08C8777425.quest_subtitle: "Head"
	quest.29448D08C8777425.title: "&cAngler's Hat"
	quest.29EA8E178F8F8FDB.quest_desc: [
		"The &9&lSimple Reforging Table&r lets you apply new &eAffixes&r to any weapon, tool, or armor piece!"
		""
		"Place the item in the center, a rarity material on the left, and a &dSigil of Rebirth&r on the right. This table supports materials up to &9Rare&r tier."
	]
	quest.29EA8E178F8F8FDB.title: "&9&lSimple Reforging Table"
	quest.2A02D797F5CABAD6.quest_desc: ["An infinite source of andesite for mass-producing Andesite Alloy."]
	quest.2A02D797F5CABAD6.quest_subtitle: "64x Andesite"
	quest.2A02D797F5CABAD6.title: "Extrusion: Andesite"
	quest.2A032EC573B5316C.quest_desc: [
		"To unlock the &2&lFrontier&r tier, equip a full set of affix armor and hold a weapon or tool with an affix, then activate the tier in the &e[ CTRL + T ]&r menu."
		""
		"• Player bonuses: +35% XP, +20% Luck, &a45 Eterna&r cap"
		"• Monster boosts: +4 Armor"
	]
	quest.2A032EC573B5316C.title: "&lWorld Tier: &2Frontier"
	quest.2A06B565FA164BA6.quest_desc: ["Combine three wireless terminals into one powerful &6Wireless Universal Grid&r! A single device in your inventory replaces your item grid, crafting table, fluid view, and autocrafting monitor."]
	quest.2A06B565FA164BA6.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate integrated terminal"
	quest.2A06B565FA164BA6.title: "One to Rule Them All: Universal Grid"
	quest.2A196974431FCC42.quest_desc: ["&cInfernal Forge&r is a giant hammer-pickaxe dropped by Netherite Monstrosity — mines at netherite level, has no durability bar, and slams the ground with a shockwave on right-click!"]
	quest.2A196974431FCC42.title: "&cInfernal Forge"
	quest.2AD78E22988A92D3.quest_desc: ["Wearing &2Night Vision Goggles&r grants night vision while exploring caves and underground depths."]
	quest.2AD78E22988A92D3.quest_subtitle: "Head"
	quest.2AD78E22988A92D3.title: "&2Night Vision Goggles"
	quest.2B08B19B35EEBCBA.quest_desc: ["You'll find the relics below inside Ruined Portals, Nether Fortresses, and Bastions across &cThe Nether&r!"]
	quest.2B08B19B35EEBCBA.quest_subtitle: "Treasures of the fiery dimension"
	quest.2B08B19B35EEBCBA.title: "Relics: &cThe Nether"
	quest.2B115519A21F9CB7.quest_desc: ["&d&lEnder Guardian&r awaits at the very bottom of the Citadel. It pulls players in with void gravity, unleashes rune waves, and upon losing half its health shatters its mask and breaks the arena floor!"]
	quest.2B115519A21F9CB7.title: "&d&lEnder Guardian&r"
	quest.2B2222D49AE2002C.quest_desc: ["Heat-treating raw rubber produces vulcanized industrial rubber. Now you can seal copper pipes and manufacture drive belts."]
	quest.2B2222D49AE2002C.quest_subtitle: "1x Cured Rubber"
	quest.2B2222D49AE2002C.title: "Vulcanized Rubber: Cured Rubber"
	quest.2B50E9FC93812730.quest_desc: ["&eDesert Temple&r from Cataclysm hides the &eKobolediator&r mini-boss inside along with rich chests tucked in its towers."]
	quest.2B50E9FC93812730.title: "&eDesert Temple"
	quest.2BCB788924BBD849.quest_desc: ["&bThe Incinerator&r is a colossal greatsword — charging a right-click attack unleashes a line of exploding pillars of fire from beneath the ground!"]
	quest.2BCB788924BBD849.title: "&bThe Incinerator"
	quest.2BF119DD5D977409.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 catalyst required for star charging in the Starlight Charger."]
	quest.2BF119DD5D977409.title: "Star Catalyst II: Azure Silver Dust"
	quest.2C0DF8D6ED259E5F.quest_desc: ["Combining the &cInfernal Forge&r hammer with the &9Astrape&r spear creates &cBron&9tes&r — a thrown weapon that calls down a lightning storm on impact!"]
	quest.2C0DF8D6ED259E5F.title: "&cBron&9tes"
	quest.2C9C4BFF1D89EF82.quest_desc: ["&3Abandoned Village&r is a deserted settlement overrun by &3Draugrs&r, full of chests hidden inside individual huts."]
	quest.2C9C4BFF1D89EF82.title: "&3Abandoned Village"
	quest.2CA03DCEF5484CFD.quest_desc: ["Run coal through millstones or crushers to get &8Coal Dust&r needed for synthesizing graphene."]
	quest.2CA03DCEF5484CFD.quest_subtitle: "Material for graphite moderator"
	quest.2CA03DCEF5484CFD.title: "Carbon Milling: Coal Dust"
	quest.2CD58FC229BC0C28.quest_desc: ["&dGauntlet of Guard&r is a trophy from Ender Guardian — holding right-click pulls all nearby enemies right in front of you!"]
	quest.2CD58FC229BC0C28.title: "&dGauntlet of Guard"
	quest.2D69B48F1EFCC9A5.quest_desc: ["&3Sturdy Boots&r let you walk freely on powder snow without sinking."]
	quest.2D69B48F1EFCC9A5.title: "&3Sturdy Boots"
	quest.2D8A7065F8CDDDDD.quest_desc: [
		"The easiest way to get spawn eggs thanks to Mob Grinding Utils!"
		""
		"Right-click a chosen mob with a Mob Swab, combine it with seeds and a bucket of liquid XP into GM Chicken Feed, then feed it to a chicken to get a ready spawn egg."
	]
	quest.2D8A7065F8CDDDDD.title: "Genetic Engineering: Mob Swab"
	quest.2DFE2B76C12BB770.quest_desc: ["Geared coins (Sprockets) of higher nominal value, used in larger-scale trades."]
	quest.2DFE2B76C12BB770.quest_subtitle: "128x Sprocket"
	quest.2DFE2B76C12BB770.title: "Currency: Geared Sprockets"
	quest.2E5D835D2B5D7078.quest_desc: ["Andesite handles kinetic stress great, but fails quickly under fluids and high pressure. Coating wood with copper opens the parallel branch of fluid engineering (Era 1.5)!"]
	quest.2E5D835D2B5D7078.quest_subtitle: "1x Copper Casing"
	quest.2E5D835D2B5D7078.title: "Sealed Construction: Copper Casing"
	quest.2E5E129F25707C5D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sigil of Supremacy&r is the crown of Apotheosis smithing!"
		""
		"Unlike Sigil of Malice, this sigil boosts EVERY affix on the chosen item at once and does not reset any stat during the process!"
	]
	quest.2E5E129F25707C5D.title: "&6Sigil of Supremacy"
	quest.2E80500D3BA79A85.quest_desc: ["Process powdered uranium into &eYellowcake&r — concentrated uranium oxide serving as the base for proper fissile fuel."]
	quest.2E80500D3BA79A85.quest_subtitle: "Chemical uranium refining"
	quest.2E80500D3BA79A85.title: "Uranium Concentrate: Yellowcake"
	quest.2EB96FF06627FD9A.quest_desc: ["The &6Salvager&r lets you break down unwanted tools and armor back into raw materials and components."]
	quest.2EB96FF06627FD9A.quest_subtitle: "Resource recovery!"
	quest.2EB96FF06627FD9A.title: "Salvager"
	quest.2EC2FA680076C07D.quest_desc: ["The second of the powerful Sculk and &9Warden Tendril&r shelves — grants &a+10 Eterna&r, &c+10% Quanta&r, &5+15% Arcana&r, and raises the Eterna cap to &a80&r!"]
	quest.2EC2FA680076C07D.title: "&9Echoing Sculkshelf"
	quest.2F3529FE1972F011.quest_desc: [
		"Local shops have limited reach, and ordinary belts or pipes stop working in unloaded chunks. Once your output reaches tens of thousands of items, it's time for &6heavy rail logistics&r!"
		""
		"Trains in &6Create&r have a unique trait: &athey can travel vast distances even through unloaded chunks&r (as long as the destination stations themselves are loaded), and they can even pass through portals into &cThe Nether&r!"
		""
		"&lUses of a rail network:&r"
		"• &eLong-range resource hauling:&r Bring ores, lava, and exotic stone from distant mines straight to your main foundry without building kilometers of belts."
		"• &bCentral Trade Hubs:&r Link distant factories to a shared trade center — a freight train automatically unloads surpluses through a &ePortable Storage Interface&r straight into your row of Vendors, turning mass production into a steady stream of coins!"
	]
	quest.2F3529FE1972F011.quest_subtitle: "Rail logistics empire"
	quest.2F3529FE1972F011.title: "MASS EXPORT"
	quest.2F5B64D5DC3F36E8.quest_desc: ["When traditional steam boilers aren't enough, it's time to tap into nuclear fission. Build a &aReactor Controller&r — the central control panel for a multiblock nuclear reactor from &2Create Nuclear&r."]
	quest.2F5B64D5DC3F36E8.quest_subtitle: "Brain of your nuclear power plant"
	quest.2F5B64D5DC3F36E8.title: "Nuclear Age: Reactor Controller"
	quest.2F62C290A5CE50F8.quest_desc: ["&eAncient Spear&r has long reach and launches destructive sandstorms on attack!"]
	quest.2F62C290A5CE50F8.title: "&eAncient Spear"
	quest.2FFEBFBE14B806C0.quest_desc: [
		"Power generated by the Alternator must reach the RS Controller. Winding copper wire onto an empty spool gives you a &6Copper Spool&r."
		""
		"Right-click two electrical connectors with it to stretch a hanging power cable between them."
	]
	quest.2FFEBFBE14B806C0.quest_subtitle: "Long-distance power transmission"
	quest.2FFEBFBE14B806C0.title: "Low-Voltage Wiring: Copper Spools"
	quest.30B16FF343C668A4.quest_desc: ["Load coal into the coking battery and produce &664 Coal Coke&r. It is the only fuel capable of sustaining ore reduction and quartz smelting in the Blast Furnace."]
	quest.30B16FF343C668A4.quest_subtitle: "High-calorie metallurgical fuel"
	quest.30B16FF343C668A4.title: "Pure Carbon: Coal Coke"
	quest.30C5D432C810F904.quest_desc: ["&9Eye of Storm&r points high above the ocean toward &9Acropolis&r, ruled by &9&lScylla&r."]
	quest.30C5D432C810F904.title: "&9Eye of Storm"
	quest.30EB438C66324213.quest_desc: ["The Solitude Rune means the spawner no longer needs a player nearby. As long as the chunk with the spawner is loaded (e.g. via FTB Chunks), production runs non-stop!"]
	quest.30EB438C66324213.title: "Ignore Player"
	quest.310969B8FE0A94DE.quest_desc: [
		"Thanks to Apothic Spawners you can mine any spawner in the world using a Silk Touch pickaxe."
		""
		"A mined spawner can then be upgraded by right-clicking it with the appropriate modifier runes."
	]
	quest.310969B8FE0A94DE.title: "Spawner Engineering"
	quest.31AA7117F83F8B86.quest_desc: ["A tireless worker in your factory. A Deployer can place components onto a belt, use tools, and assemble multi-step mechanisms with ideal repeatability."]
	quest.31AA7117F83F8B86.quest_subtitle: "1x Deployer"
	quest.31AA7117F83F8B86.title: "Assembly Arm: Deployer"
	quest.31E7F7464D79F881.quest_desc: ["Besides bookshelves themselves, you can also perform &d&lInfusion&r on many useful tools, books, and minerals!"]
	quest.31E7F7464D79F881.title: "Other &d&lInfusion&r Items"
	quest.31FE06D7BD761156.quest_desc: [
		"In this pack, money makes the world go 'round! The official currency is coins from Create Numismatics (from small Spurs and Bevels up to Sprocket, Cog, and Crown)."
		""
		"You can earn coins by completing harder quests, defeating bosses, and selling surplus materials in special machines. You can spend earned cash in the shop or at vending machines placed around the world. Tuck this coin deep into your pocket!"
	]
	quest.31FE06D7BD761156.quest_subtitle: "(Earning)"
	quest.31FE06D7BD761156.title: "Economy and You"
	quest.321C15EBBE2D3D30.quest_desc: [
		"Blowing up a spawner with TNT destabilizes its structure — before breaking it releases a wave of monsters and leaves 48 to 57 Spawner Chains."
		""
		"These chains are the base material for forging all modifier runes."
	]
	quest.321C15EBBE2D3D30.title: "Explosive Salvage: Chains"
	quest.321F16645640C462.quest_desc: ["&9Warp Drive&r makes thrown Ender Pearls unconsumed and negates fall damage, draining a small amount of hunger instead!"]
	quest.321F16645640C462.quest_subtitle: "Belt"
	quest.321F16645640C462.title: "&9Warp Drive&r"
	quest.3223B14E53AACFB5.quest_desc: ["Semaphores from *Steam 'n' Rails* add atmospheric classic light and mechanical signals that make traffic organization easier at large rail junctions."]
	quest.3223B14E53AACFB5.quest_subtitle: "1x Semaphore"
	quest.3223B14E53AACFB5.title: "Rail Signaling: Semaphore"
	quest.330DC46048D1DD2C.quest_desc: ["A copper variant of the transfer interface. Used for wirelessly pumping fluids (like lava or oil) into and out of train tanks while stopped at a station."]
	quest.330DC46048D1DD2C.quest_subtitle: "1x Portable Fluid Interface"
	quest.330DC46048D1DD2C.title: "Fluid Transfer: Portable Fluid Interface"
	quest.3311B79A8F6C6ADD.quest_desc: ["The &6&lEnchanting Table of the Raven&r is the ultimate enchanting table where you can freely set &aEterna&r, &cQuanta&r, and &5Arcana&r values without placing any shelves around it!"]
	quest.3311B79A8F6C6ADD.quest_subtitle: "Quoth the Raven: Nevermore"
	quest.3311B79A8F6C6ADD.title: "&6&lEnchanting Table of the Raven"
	quest.33664C509F66A6E2.quest_desc: ["Mine the crystalline amethyst blocks lining the inside of a discovered geode."]
