	quest.34D17EBBA4F9CA1F.title: "Extrusion: Diorite"
	quest.34DB788A15B67B4B.quest_desc: ["Pipes won't move fluids on their own. Connect a Mechanical Pump to a shaft to give direction and pressure to the whole setup."]
