	quest.37E556B4A730E5AA.quest_desc: ["Notice your &aEterna&r stopping at &a30&r? To break past that threshold and reach &a45 Eterna&r, you need to unlock the &2&lFrontier&r world tier in the &e[ CTRL + T ]&r menu!"]
