	quest.6220EDE42C813C1B.quest_desc: ["Tired of potion charms (&eCharms&r) wearing out? Perform an &d&lInfusion&r at &a100 Eterna&r, &c8.5–13.5% Quanta&r, and &532.5–37.5% Arcana&r to make them completely unbreakable!"]
