	quest.6313CA2B81D9D8A3.title: "4k Data Disk"
	quest.631796E7615C04FA.quest_desc: ["&2Amethyst Crab&r is a neutral mini-boss in Lush Caves. Defeating it drops meat (which can be blessed at an amethyst altar) and a shell for forging Bloom Stone Pauldrons."]
